Package: crop-recording
Version: 1.2.6
Architecture: all
Section: video
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Crop Recording <crop-recording@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-xlib, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, ffmpeg, libnotify-bin
Conflicts: croprec
Replaces: croprec
Description: Record a selected region of an X11 desktop
 Use Ctrl+Alt+A to open the area picker, start recording, and stop recording.
 Crop Recording shows elapsed time outside the selected area and offers to
 save the lossless RGB H.264 MP4 or copy it for pasting as a file.
